.TH batten-provision-apply 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-provision\-apply \- Fetch, verify against the pinned checksum, and install into the out\-of\-tree cache
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten provision apply\fR [\fB\-n\fR|\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fetch, verify against the pinned checksum, and install into the out\-of\-tree cache
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Preview what would be applied, writing nothing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
